Both should pass.

### Step 8: Commit

```bash
git add src/render/gpu.rs src/render/hud.rs src/audio/hitsound.rs src/app.rs src/lib.rs
git commit -m "feat: wire AssetLoader through all subsystems

GPU textures, audio, hitsound, HUD font all load via AssetLoader.
App creates AssetLoader from filesystem (desktop) or AndroidApp (Android).
Old path-based HitsoundEngine::new removed."
```

## Context

BetterArc is an Arcaea rhythm game simulator in Rust. This task connects the AssetLoader (created in Task 1) to all subsystems. The _from_bytes variants were added in Tasks 2-4. This task switches everything over and removes old filesystem-based loading.

Key types already available:
- `crate::assets::AssetLoader` — has `load_bytes(&str) -> Result<Vec<u8>>`, `load_string(&str) -> Result<String>`
- `texture::load_texture_from_bytes(device, queue, layout, &[u8], label) -> BindGroup`
- `AudioEngine::play_ogg_bytes(Vec<u8>, i32) -> Result<Self>`
- `HitsoundEngine::with_assets(&AssetLoader) -> Option<Self>`
- `Camera::inv_view_proj() -> Mat4` (already added in camera.rs)

The `HitsoundEngine::new()` old constructor and `load_wav(&Path, ...)` should be removed since `with_assets` replaces them entirely.

