3. `src/app.rs` — Change App struct, create AssetLoader in resumed(), platform-gated
4. `src/lib.rs` — Pass AndroidApp to App::new on Android
5. `src/audio/hitsound.rs` — Remove old new() and load_wav methods

## Detailed Steps

### Step 1: Change HudRenderer::new in src/render/hud.rs

Current signature (line 26):
```rust
pub fn new(
    device: &wgpu::Device,
    queue: &wgpu::Queue,
    format: wgpu::TextureFormat,
) -> Option<Self> {
```

Change to:
```rust
pub fn new(
    device: &wgpu::Device,
    queue: &wgpu::Queue,
    format: wgpu::TextureFormat,
    assets: &crate::assets::AssetLoader,
) -> Option<Self> {
```

Replace the font loading block (lines 31-41):
```rust
